    "statement": "A train-prefix-only robust seasonal and adjacent-layer graph baseline, followed by fixed multiscale Haar level, slope, curvature, and cross-layer coherence residual geometry, contains offset/drift information that the frozen incumbent and prior unary families did not identify. A single deterministic unary head may add sustained slow-anomaly rows while preserving every incumbent positive; otherwise the output is the exact incumbent byte sequence.",
